5498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 t^{3} e^{t} + 9 t^{2} e^{t} + 2 e^{t} \\\\ - 3 t^{2} e^{t} + 6 t e^{t} + e^{t} \\\\ t e^{t} - 3 e^{t}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541236} {:answer/id #uuid "933be270-ad3f-5f06-82f3-5bc03d4c07db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 t^{3} e^{t} - 9 t^{2} + 2 e^{t} \\\\ - 3 t^{2} e^{t} - 6 t + e^{t} \\\\ t e^{t} - 2 e^{t} + 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541252} {:answer/id #uuid "a5fdc7f9-96e3-5ea2-89c3-7785837cf9df" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 t^{3} e^{t} + 2 e^{t} \\\\ - 3 t^{2} e^{t} + e^{t} \\\\ t e^{t} - 2 e^{t}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541257} {:answer/id #uuid "a68099ca-52c0-5a5f-8c61-c1998440b2d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 t^{3} e^{t} - 9 t^{2} e^{t} + 2 e^{t} \\\\ - 3 t^{2} e^{t} - 6 t e^{t} + e^{t} \\\\ t e^{t} - e^{t}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541258} {:answer/id #uuid "b77e088e-1a80-5d74-b785-a5d73c674312" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 9 t^{2} e^{t} \\\\ - 6 t e^{t} \\\\ e^{t}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541261}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a68099ca-52c0-5a5f-8c61-c1998440b2d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 t^{3} e^{t} - 9 t^{2} e^{t} + 2 e^{t} \\\\ - 3 t^{2} e^{t} - 6 t e^{t} + e^{t} \\\\ t e^{t} - e^{t}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541258} :answer-field/id #uuid "03670b85-3c78-503a-8306-9e91be6eeb6a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541231}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "cd42c404-9455-5280-9779-d91dd036c7b6" :question/problem "Find $(u(t)f(t))^{′}$ where $f(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}2 - 3 t^{3} \\\\ 1 - 3 t^{2} \\\\ t - 2\\end{bmatrix}$ and $u(t)=e^{t}.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the scalar function multiple rule, we can write\n\n$$\n(u(t)f(t))^{′}=u^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t)f^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find $u^{′}(t)$ and $f^{′}(t).$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f^{′}(t)&=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2 - 3 t^{3}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1 - 3 t^{2}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t - 2)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}- 9 t^{2} \\\\ - 6 t \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\\\u^{′}(t)&=\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(e^{t})=e^{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(u(t)f(t))^{′}&=u^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t)f^{′}(t)\\\\&=(e^{t})\\begin{bmatrix}2 - 3 t^{3} \\\\ 1 - 3 t^{2} \\\\ t - 2\\end{bmatrix}+(e^{t})\\begin{bmatrix}- 9 t^{2} \\\\ - 6 t \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\\\\&=\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(2 - 3 t^{3}\\right) e^{t} \\\\ \\left(1 - 3 t^{2}\\right) e^{t} \\\\ \\left(t - 2\\right) e^{t}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- 9 t^{2} e^{t} \\\\ - 6 t e^{t} \\\\ e^{t}\\end{bmatrix}\\\\&=\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(- 3 t^{3} - 9 t^{2} + 2\\right) e^{t} \\\\ \\left(- 3 t^{2} - 6 t + 1\\right) e^{t} \\\\ \\left(t - 1\\right) e^{t}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186541268 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18e01a93-bfdd-5d60-b008-8c0b11015eed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 t + 9 - \\frac{6}{t} \\\\ t^{2} e^{t} - 3 t e^{t} + 2 e^{t} \\\\ -1 + \\frac{3}{t} - \\frac{2}{t^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541234} {:answer/id #uuid "3d02bfeb-b1f1-5e6c-b4a5-b5137a3b7eab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 6 t \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} - 3 t + 9 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} + 9 - \\frac{6}{t} \\\\ t^{2} e^{t} - t e^{t} - e^{t} \\\\ 1 - \\frac{2}{t^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541239} {:answer/id #uuid "56d49eae-7ec5-5872-b426-29429faf867e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 6 t \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} + 3 t + 9 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} - 9 + \\frac{6}{t} \\\\ - t^{2} e^{t} + 5 t e^{t} - 5 e^{t} \\\\ 3 - \\frac{6}{t} + \\frac{2}{t^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541244} {:answer/id #uuid "a594b3fd-3990-519f-9b9e-837f8cfe919d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 6 t \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} + 9 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} \\\\ 2 t e^{t} - 3 e^{t} \\\\ 2 - \\frac{3}{t}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541256} {:answer/id #uuid "cb52a2d0-993c-52aa-a62e-df68c4e7cfdc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 + \\frac{9}{t} \\\\ 2 t e^{t} - 3 e^{t} \\\\ - \\frac{2}{t} + \\frac{3}{t^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541265}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3d02bfeb-b1f1-5e6c-b4a5-b5137a3b7eab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 6 t \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} - 3 t + 9 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} + 9 - \\frac{6}{t} \\\\ t^{2} e^{t} - t e^{t} - e^{t} \\\\ 1 - \\frac{2}{t^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541239} :answer-field/id #uuid "e2a83f6e-4bfe-53c6-99e0-f32bda4ce4df" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541270}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "d6931a3c-17b8-55a5-9c5d-652d29b81597" :question/problem "Find $(u(t)f(t))^{′}$ where $f(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} \\\\ e^{t} \\\\ \\frac{1}{t}\\end{bmatrix}$ and $u(t)=t^{2} - 3 t + 2.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the scalar function multiple rule, we can write\n\n$$\n(u(t)f(t))^{′}=u^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t)f^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find $u^{′}(t)$ and $f^{′}(t).$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f^{′}(t)&=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(- 3 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(e^{t}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}\\left(\\frac{1}{t}\\right)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{3}{t} \\\\ e^{t} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{t^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}\\\\u^{′}(t)&=\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t^{2} - 3 t + 2)=2 t - 3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(u(t)f(t))^{′}&=u^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t)f^{′}(t)\\\\&=(2 t - 3)\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} \\\\ e^{t} \\\\ \\frac{1}{t}\\end{bmatrix}+(t^{2} - 3 t + 2)\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{3}{t} \\\\ e^{t} \\\\ - \\frac{1}{t^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}\\\\&=\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 \\left(2 t - 3\\right) \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} \\\\ \\left(2 t - 3\\right) e^{t} \\\\ \\frac{2 t - 3}{t}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{3 \\left(t^{2} - 3 t + 2\\right)}{t} \\\\ \\left(t^{2} - 3 t + 2\\right) e^{t} \\\\ - \\frac{t^{2} - 3 t + 2}{t^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}\\\\&=\\begin{bmatrix}- 6 t \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} - 3 t + 9 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} + 9 - \\frac{6}{t} \\\\ \\left(t^{2} - t - 1\\right) e^{t} \\\\ 1 - \\frac{2}{t^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186552684 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "021ce696-af7d-5021-bc33-6a13b7b4b647" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)} \\\\ - e^{u} \\\\ 4 u\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552681} {:answer/id #uuid "3b4a7db4-aa22-5d7d-a78d-c70a01578d67" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(6 - 18 t^{2}\\right) \\cos{\\left(3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ - e^{3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1} \\\\ 12 t^{3} - 12 t + 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552697} {:answer/id #uuid "6cfd4ddf-3dcd-554b-9ecc-3d1b852b2fdf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(6 - 18 t^{2}\\right) \\cos{\\left(3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ \\left(3 - 9 t^{2}\\right) e^{3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1} \\\\ 108 t^{5} - 144 t^{3} + 36 t^{2} + 36 t - 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552710} {:answer/id #uuid "c7b01f0f-ea76-5af7-9c7f-24821908ac1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\left(9 t^{2} - 3\\right)^{2} \\cos{\\left(3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ - \\left(9 t^{2} - 3\\right)^{2} e^{3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1} \\\\ 972 t^{7} - 1620 t^{5} + 324 t^{4} + 756 t^{3} - 216 t^{2} - 108 t + 36\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552727} {:answer/id #uuid "f7e04f69-8ef2-533f-a056-fddebfaf74c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ - e^{3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1} \\\\ 12 t^{3} - 12 t + 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6cfd4ddf-3dcd-554b-9ecc-3d1b852b2fdf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(6 - 18 t^{2}\\right) \\cos{\\left(3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ \\left(3 - 9 t^{2}\\right) e^{3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1} \\\\ 108 t^{5} - 144 t^{3} + 36 t^{2} + 36 t - 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552710} :answer-field/id #uuid "eb3fb72f-55f1-58b6-9944-639c02b17af9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552742}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "11260fcf-5135-53eb-8adc-f88951a23672" :question/problem "If $f(u)=\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)} \\\\ - e^{u} \\\\ 2 u^{2}\\end{bmatrix}$ and $u(t)=3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1$, then $(f∘u)^{′}(t)=$ Write the polynomial component in expanded form." :question/worked-solution "Using the chain rule, we can write\n\n$$\n(f∘u)^{′}(t)=f′(u(t))u′(t)\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f^{′}(u) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}\\left(- 2 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}\\left(- e^{u}\\right) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}\\left(2 u^{2}\\right)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)} \\\\ - e^{u} \\\\ 4 u\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ u^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}\\left(3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1\\right)=9 t^{2} - 3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f∘u)^{′}(t) & =f′(u(t))u′(t) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(u(t) \\right)} \\\\ - e^{u(t)} \\\\ 4 u(t)\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\left(u^{′}(t)\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ - e^{3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1} \\\\ 12 t^{3} - 12 t + 4\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\left(9 t^{2} - 3\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(6 - 18 t^{2}\\right) \\cos{\\left(3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ \\left(3 - 9 t^{2}\\right) e^{3 t^{3} - 3 t + 1} \\\\ 108 t^{5} - 144 t^{3} + 36 t^{2} + 36 t - 12\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186552696 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "09d5ff92-70e0-5ad1-8432-25c0d6bcbe02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2 \\right)} \\\\ 2 e^{- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2} \\\\ 12 t^{3} - 18 t - 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552682} {:answer/id #uuid "27979692-1d64-59fb-9f9f-fc39501f7804" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\left(3 - 6 t^{2}\\right)^{2} \\cos{\\left(- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2 \\right)} \\\\ 2 \\left(3 - 6 t^{2}\\right)^{2} e^{- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2} \\\\ 432 t^{7} - 1080 t^{5} - 432 t^{4} + 756 t^{3} + 432 t^{2} - 162 t - 108\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552691} {:answer/id #uuid "28327a44-c1ac-582b-987e-9e64578948a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(12 t^{2} - 6\\right) \\cos{\\left(- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2 \\right)} \\\\ \\left(6 - 12 t^{2}\\right) e^{- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2} \\\\ - 72 t^{5} + 144 t^{3} + 72 t^{2} - 54 t - 36\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552692} {:answer/id #uuid "c0959c4b-2400-5f48-a5f4-3b5997b90122" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)} \\\\ 2 e^{u} \\\\ - 6 u\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552725} {:answer/id #uuid "c5b07b53-9d50-5ba3-a7c4-aced7951739b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(12 t^{2} - 6\\right) \\cos{\\left(- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2 \\right)} \\\\ 2 e^{- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2} \\\\ 12 t^{3} - 18 t - 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552726}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "28327a44-c1ac-582b-987e-9e64578948a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(12 t^{2} - 6\\right) \\cos{\\left(- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2 \\right)} \\\\ \\left(6 - 12 t^{2}\\right) e^{- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2} \\\\ - 72 t^{5} + 144 t^{3} + 72 t^{2} - 54 t - 36\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552692} :answer-field/id #uuid "648a992c-7cd3-512a-a110-1794d6be27ac" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552708}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "3785616b-b5d5-5408-ac3e-f4da8e1bd20b" :question/problem "If $f(u)=\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)} \\\\ 2 e^{u} \\\\ - 3 u^{2}\\end{bmatrix}$ and $u(t)=- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2$, then $(f∘u)^{′}(t)=$ Write the polynomial component in expanded form." :question/worked-solution "Using the chain rule, we can write\n\n$$\n(f∘u)^{′}(t)=f′(u(t))u′(t)\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f^{′}(u) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}\\left(- 2 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}\\left(2 e^{u}\\right) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}\\left(- 3 u^{2}\\right)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)} \\\\ 2 e^{u} \\\\ - 6 u\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ u^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}\\left(- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2\\right)=3 - 6 t^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f∘u)^{′}(t) & =f′(u(t))u′(t) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(u(t) \\right)} \\\\ 2 e^{u(t)} \\\\ - 6 u(t)\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\left(u^{′}(t)\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- 2 \\cos{\\left(- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2 \\right)} \\\\ 2 e^{- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2} \\\\ 12 t^{3} - 18 t - 12\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\left(3 - 6 t^{2}\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(12 t^{2} - 6\\right) \\cos{\\left(- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2 \\right)} \\\\ \\left(6 - 12 t^{2}\\right) e^{- 2 t^{3} + 3 t + 2} \\\\ - 72 t^{5} + 144 t^{3} + 72 t^{2} - 54 t - 36\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186552698 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "118b60d1-16bd-5591-a820-cc55b25ca943" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\left(1 - 3 t^{2}\\right)^{2} \\cos{\\left(- t^{3} + t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ 3 \\left(1 - 3 t^{2}\\right)^{2} e^{- t^{3} + t + 1} \\\\ - 18 t^{7} + 30 t^{5} + 18 t^{4} - 14 t^{3} - 12 t^{2} + 2 t + 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552685} {:answer/id #uuid "73145cfa-b052-59ce-9a27-a37c225a3656" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(3 t^{2} - 1\\right) \\cos{\\left(- t^{3} + t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ 3 e^{- t^{3} + t + 1} \\\\ - 2 t^{3} + 2 t + 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592