 of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f^{′}(u) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}\\left(- \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}\\left(3 e^{u}\\right) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}\\left(u^{2}\\right)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)} \\\\ 3 e^{u} \\\\ 2 u\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ u^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}\\left(- t^{3} + t + 1\\right)=1 - 3 t^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f∘u)^{′}(t) & =f′(u(t))u′(t) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- \\cos{\\left(u(t) \\right)} \\\\ 3 e^{u(t)} \\\\ 2 u(t)\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\left(u^{′}(t)\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- \\cos{\\left(- t^{3} + t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ 3 e^{- t^{3} + t + 1} \\\\ - 2 t^{3} + 2 t + 2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\left(1 - 3 t^{2}\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(3 t^{2} - 1\\right) \\cos{\\left(- t^{3} + t + 1 \\right)} \\\\ \\left(3 - 9 t^{2}\\right) e^{- t^{3} + t + 1} \\\\ 6 t^{5} - 8 t^{3} - 6 t^{2} + 2 t + 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186552702 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0b346b07-af0c-5590-b674-93141858d0c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\left(2 - 8 t\\right) \\cos{\\left(- 2 t^{2} + t + 2 \\right)} \\\\ \\left(2 - 8 t\\right) e^{- 2 t^{2} + t + 2} \\\\ 4 \\left(4 t - 1\\right) \\left(- 2 t^{2} + t + 2\\right)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552683} {:answer/id #uuid "4843bafc-ec0c-5368-b76f-17d78c17eda3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\cos{\\left(- 2 t^{2} + t + 2 \\right)} \\\\ 2 e^{- 2 t^{2} + t + 2} \\\\ 8 t^{2} - 4 t - 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552701} {:answer/id #uuid "8ff1af46-2488-5c13-bd2b-2404c9fef506" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\left(1 - 4 t\\righ